  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Grand Swine grotto-heaven’s two super resource points are rolling fall cliff and pin tree snowfield. Pin tree snowfield is home to grand swines: immemorial black pigs whose bones are black, bodies as large as mountains, and movement slow. The snowfield is extremely vast. Fang Yuan places it in Mini Northern Plains, increasing that area’s size by twenty percent, with over five hundred grand swines of all sizes and ages.",
      "chapters": [
        2072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_grand_swine_grotto_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_mini_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During calamities and tribulations across the sovereign immortal aperture, Star Collection City hears that ghost fire is burning pin tree snowfield and that if it is not stopped in time the ghost fire will destroy the whole snowfield.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ghost-fire-threat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_collection_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later report states that most of the tribulation clouds above the pin tree snowfield have dissipated.",
      "chapters": [
        2205
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribulation-clouds",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yu Zi lists pin tree snowfield among known super resource points in the sovereign immortal aperture, together with rolling fall cliff, triple sacred mountain, divine needle valley, frost dragon pond, water spider sea, and heavenly crystal storage pool.",
